sequenceDiagram
  actor Client
  participant API as apps/api (RunsController)
  participant Redis
  participant Queue as queue:agent-continuations

  Client->>API: POST /api/v1/runs/:runId/continue (continueRun)
  Note right of API: apps/api/src/api/runs.controller.ts:300-423 continueRun
  API->>API: ContinueRunSchema.parse
  alt Valid runId & run exists & tenant OK
    API->>Redis: get run:runId
    API->>API: Push user step & set status=running
    API->>Redis: setex run:runId JSON
    API->>API: queueRunContinuation(runId, data)
    API->>Queue: lpush queue:agent-continuations {runId, message}
    API-->>Client: 200 { run }
  else Invalid UUID
    API-->>Client: 400 INVALID_RUN_ID
  else Not Found
    API-->>Client: 404 RUN_NOT_FOUND
  else Tenant Denied
    API-->>Client: 403 TENANT_ACCESS_DENIED
  else Not Continuable
    API-->>Client: 400 RUN_NOT_CONTINUABLE
  end
  opt Internal Failure
    API-->>Client: 500 INTERNAL_ERROR
  end
